+    *   **HE Score ($s_i^{HE}$):** Assign a high score to Gaussians with large error-weighted contribution using a percentile score based on rank:
+        $$ s_i^{HE} = \frac{1}{N-1} \sum_{j=1}^N \mathbb{1}[C_j^{HE} < C_i^{HE}] $$
